        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-16T01:01:16.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Negative field would definitely affect a target that triggered it, its HP doesn't have timing. &nbsp;There is no activation of it being a target, it is a target, once it enters play it is a target that is in play.</p><p>Yeah, timing isn't the issue there.</p>",
